    // ---- Guns (#72; zombye_sim::ranged) -----------------------------------------------------------
    // A `Firearm` shoots: `ranged` says what it is loaded with (items in items.ron), how far a
    // bullet flies, how far off the aim it may go (degrees, standing and extra on the move), how
    // many pellets a shot and what is left of their damage at the end of the range. Of the numbers
    // above it uses: damage (each pellet's), windup_seconds (trigger to shot), swing_seconds (shot
    // to shot), max_targets (bodies one bullet goes through), crit_multiplier (a hit to the head),
    // knockback, stagger_chance, knockdown_chance, endurance_cost (the recoil) and noise_radius
    // (up to 300 m: a shot wakes the street and draws the far horde over the next minutes).
    // range, arc_degrees and crit_chance aren't read. Never on a floor: loot tables only, rare.
    //   pistol   quick, twelve in a magazine, a head shot or three to the body
    //   rifle    one zombie a round at any distance, through two in a line; slow bolt, loudest
    //   shotgun  eight pellets: everything close in front of you, little past 20 m
    (
        id: "pistol",
        name: "Pistol",
